+# warm-up, a uniform average of every iterate of steps 10,000 to 20,000, an EMA 0.9998, BN recalibration on the training
+# fold at the end, the encoder probe every 2,000 steps), weights_key swad_bn and the 6 readouts. Model, encoder weights
+# file, data, loss, PF settings, steps and batch = the HRNet card (its header holds architecture, licence, parameters).
+# Pre-declared primary readout: swad_bn; declared secondary readout: swad. The encoder probe names one stage 'model' on
+# this encoder (timm tensor names encoder.model.*), not layer3 / layer4; it is a log only.
+# Proof of the two equalities: tests/test_bench_c3x_card.py.
+name: hrnet_w18_unetpp_swad_const_pf_v11
+version: 1
+family: cnn-hrnet-unetpp
+papers: ["arXiv:1908.07919", "arXiv:2102.08604", "arXiv:2411.18704"]
+kind: harness
+config: configs/supervised.yaml
+opts:
+  - data.labeled_fraction=1.0
+  - training.total_steps=20000
+  - data.split_seed=0
+  - training.labeled_batch_size=8
+  - data.mask_subdir=masks_v11
+  - data.mask_ignore_value=255
+  - model.name=bench_smp
+  - model.decoder=unetplusplus
+  - model.encoder_name=tu-hrnet_w18
+  - model.encoder_weights=imagenet
+  - data.augmentation=labelsafe
+  - loss.supervised=ce_dice
+  - training.val_every=20000
+  - training.encoder_pf.freeze=1000
+  - training.encoder_pf.ramp=1000
+  - training.encoder_pf.lr_mult=0.1
+  - training.encoder_pf.wd=0
+  - training.lr_scheduler=constant
+  - training.weight_avg.swad.mode=uniform
+  - training.weight_avg.swad.start=10000
+  - training.weight_avg.swad.end=20000
+  - training.weight_avg.ema_9998.mode=ema
+  - training.weight_avg.ema_9998.decay=0.9998
+  - training.bn_recal=true
+  - training.enc_probe_every=2000
+weights:
+  - path: /home/noob/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--timm--hrnet_w18.ms_aug_in1k/snapshots/7e2c5583769f54514fd87e3ba9de408e33eaba0f/model.safetensors
+    md5: e6bb005ddbe1b52bde05618fc6b4b8e3
+weights_key: swad_bn
+readouts:
+  - {name: raw, weights_key: model}
+  - {name: raw_bn, weights_key: raw_bn}
+  - {name: swad, weights_key: swad}
+  - {name: swad_bn, weights_key: swad_bn}
+  - {name: ema_9998, weights_key: ema_9998}
+  - {name: ema_9998_bn, weights_key: ema_9998_bn}
+decision_rule: argmax24
+memory:
+  peak_mib: null
+  gate_mib: 11000
+  source: "peak not measured (built on CPU). Basis of the gate: hrnet_w18_unetpp_pf_v11 peak 8,430 MiB on cv02; the averagers swad and ema_9998 and the probe start copy add about 0.2 GB of weights (swad_const_pf_v11 added 324 MiB to PF on gaint); expected peak 8,650 to 8,760 MiB, + 2,048 = at most 10,808; gate 11,000 (the gate of swad_const_pf_v11). A GPU smoke measures it before the launch."
+external: null
+diff_ref: hrnet_w18_unetpp_pf_v11
+notes: "c3x: hrnet_w18_unetpp_pf_v11 plus the changes of swad_const_pf_v11 (constant lr, swad 10k to 20k, ema_9998, bn_recal, enc probe). readouts: model (constant-lr raw), raw_bn, swad, swad_bn (primary), ema_9998, ema_9998_bn. Encoder drift: train.log 'ENC probe' lines and enc_probe.jsonl (one stage, model)."
